WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Read the parent summary.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.400
V.O.I.C.E. can write a one-page summary
of how your child is talking.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
It uses plain words and no percentages,

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.800
and it prints cleanly.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Pick a month.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.700
Read what changed: the new words your
child started using,

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.600
their favorite words,

8
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.600
and the longest message.

9
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.500
Look at Words to practice at home.

10
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:43.500
Every word being taught right now is there, each with
an everyday activity written for parents.

11
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:51.000
When a word is mastered, it moves off the list.

12
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.000
Everything stays on the iPad unless
an adult exports it.

13
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
